---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 480
---
flowchart TB
    ALL["every file under the root"] --> S1["stage 1 — group by SIZE<br/>(a stat call; nothing is read)"]
    S1 --> S2["stage 2 — only groups of 2+ survive:<br/>hash the first 4 KB (one cheap read)"]
    S2 --> S3["stage 3 — survivors only: full streaming hash<br/>(the one genuinely expensive read)"]:::good
    S3 --> DUP["whatever still shares a hash is a duplicate group"]:::good
    S1 -. "alone at this size" .-> OUT["never opened at all —<br/>the cheap stages do the eliminating"]:::warn
    S2 -. "differs in the first 4 KB" .-> OUT
    classDef good fill:#dafbe1,stroke:#1a7f37
    classDef warn fill:#fff8e6,stroke:#d4a72c
